msgid "Using Security with WebAuthn"
msgstr "使用WebAuthn的安全性"

msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates how your Quarkus application can use WebAuthn authentication instead of\n"
"passwords."
msgstr "本指南演示了你的Quarkus应用程序如何使用WebAuthn认证来代替密码。"

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "这项技术被认为是{extension-status}。"

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr "在 _preview(预览)_ 中，不保证向后兼容和在生态系统中的存在。具体的改进可能需要改变配置或API，并且正在计划变得 _稳定_ 。欢迎在我们的 link:https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[邮件列表] 中提供反馈，或在我们的 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub问题列表] 中提出问题。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "如需查看所有可能状态的完整列表，请参阅我们的 link:https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[常见问题解答] 。"

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr "要完成这个指南，你需要："

msgid "Roughly 15 minutes"
msgstr "大概15分钟"

msgid "An IDE"
msgstr "编辑器"

msgid "JDK 11+ installed with `JAVA_HOME` configured appropriately"
msgstr "安装JDK 11以上版本并正确配置了 `JAVA_HOME`"

msgid "Apache Maven {maven-version}"
msgstr "Apache Maven {maven-version}"

msgid "Optionally the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] if you want to use it"
msgstr "如果你愿意的话，还可以选择使用xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI]"

